@startuml Hinh_2_13_Sequence_Crypto_OnChain_Web3j
title Hình 2.13 – Sequence: Giao dịch Crypto on-chain (Web3j)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Web/Mobile" as UI
participant "CryptoTransactionController" as Ctrl
participant "GasEstimationService" as Gas
participant "ERC20Service" as ERC20
participant "Web3j\n(JsonRpc)" as Web3j
participant "Blockchain\n(ETH/BSC/Polygon)" as Chain
participant "EtherscanService" as Explorer
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Ước tính phí gas ==
User -> UI : Nhập địa chỉ nhận + số lượng token
UI -> Ctrl : POST /crypto/transactions/estimate-gas
Ctrl -> Gas : estimateGas(from, to, data)
Gas -> Web3j : eth_estimateGas
Web3j -> Chain : RPC call
Chain --> Gas : gas limit + gas price
Gas --> Ctrl : GasEstimateResponse
Ctrl --> UI : Hiển thị phí ước tính

== Ký & broadcast ==
User -> UI : Ký tx (private key / WalletConnect)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /crypto/transactions/broadcast\n{signedTransactionHex}
Ctrl -> Web3j : eth_sendRawTransaction
Web3j -> Chain : Broadcast signed tx
Chain --> Web3j : transactionHash
Ctrl -> DB : Lưu CryptoTransaction\n(SEND, PENDING/SUCCESS)
Ctrl --> UI : txHash
UI --> User : Link explorer

== Đồng bộ lịch sử (fallback) ==
UI -> Ctrl : GET /crypto/wallets/{id}/history
Ctrl -> Explorer : getTransactionHistory(address, network)
Explorer --> Ctrl : Etherscan V2 API
Ctrl --> UI : Danh sách tx on-chain

@enduml
